Characteristics
        Maintains insertion order
        Allows duplicate values
        Allows index-based access
        Usually allows multiple nulls

      Method                         Purpose
  add()                       Insert element
  get()                       Retrieve element
  set()                       Update element
  remove()                    Delete element
  contains()                  Search
  size()                      Number of elements
  clear()                     Remove all elements
  isEmpty()                   Check empty collection
